### Phase 1 API Testing - User & Trust Management
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these requests

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api/v1
@adminToken = YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 2. Admin Login (Local Dev)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login/admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@ideal.local",
  "password": "<LOCAL_ADMIN_PASSWORD>"
}

### 3. Get Current Admin Session
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/session
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 4. Get Users Directory (Page 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 5. Get Users Directory (Page 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=2&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 6. Get Users Directory (Custom Page Size)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Override Trust Metrics - Example 1 (Fraud Correction)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": 10,
  "ongoingDeals": 2,
  "breachedDeals": 0,
  "reason": "Correction manuelle suite à investigation fraude cas #2024-FR-001"
}

### 8. Override Trust Metrics - Example 2 (Dispute Resolution)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": 25,
  "ongoingDeals": 5,
  "breachedDeals": 2,
  "reason": "Résolution de litige - ticket support #SUPP-12345 - verdict en faveur de l'utilisateur"
}

### 9. Override Trust Metrics - Example 3 (Reset to Zero)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": 0,
  "ongoingDeals": 0,
  "breachedDeals": 0,
  "reason": "Réinitialisation complète demandée par utilisateur après suppression de compte et recréation"
}

### 10. Get Pending KYC Queue (Coming in Phase 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/kyc/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Test Error - Missing Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10

### 12. Test Error - Invalid Token
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/users?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token_12345

### 13. Test Error - Reason Too Short (should fail validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": 5,
  "ongoingDeals": 1,
  "breachedDeals": 0,
  "reason": "Short"
}

### 14. Test Error - Missing Reason (should fail validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": 5,
  "ongoingDeals": 1,
  "breachedDeals": 0
}

### 15. Test Error - Negative Values (should fail validation)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/USER_PROFILE_ID_HERE/trust-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "successfulDeals": -5,
  "ongoingDeals": 1,
  "breachedDeals": 0,
  "reason": "Testing negative values validation"
}

